ent-WeaponRifleWSPRTarkhan = PD-VI LA/22 "Kord" (7.62x51mm)
    .desc = A WSPR adapted into a 7.62x51mm GPMG for Tarkhans, somehow still integrally suppressed. An Erebus railmount is present on the top of the reciever for optics.
ent-WeaponLMGPKMS = PD-VI PKMS (5.56x45mm)
